{
  "uid": "aws-services-overview",
  "title": "AWS Services \u2014 RDS / Lambda / ALB Overview (YACE)",
  "description": "CloudWatch service metrics pulled via YACE (yet-another-cloudwatch-exporter). Complements the log-derived metrics from cloudwatch-log-metrics. Panels template on the resource dimensions YACE emits so this works for any AWS account.",
  "tags": [
    "yace",
    "aws",
    "cloudwatch"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 4,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Deployments",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "Prometheus"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "expr": "deploy_event",
        "step": "60s",
        "tagKeys": "service,env,version,source",
        "titleFormat": "deploy {{service}} {{version}}",
        "textFormat": "env={{env}} source={{source}}",
        "useValueForTime": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "rds_cluster",
        "label": "RDS cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "Prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(aws_rds_database_connections_average, dimension_DBClusterIdentifier)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      },
      {
        "name": "lambda_fn",
        "label": "Lambda function",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "Prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(aws_lambda_invocations_sum, dimension_FunctionName)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      },
      {
        "name": "alb",
        "label": "ALB",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "Prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(aws_applicationelb_request_count_sum, dimension_LoadBalancer)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## What to do based on what you see\n\n| If you see... | Go to... | Then... |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Lambda \u2014 functions with any error > 0** | **Lambda \u2014 Triage** section below | Read the error-rate line + top table. If rate is red (>5%), suspect the most recent deploy marker on the graph. |\n| **RDS \u2014 CPU >= 80% right now > 0** | RDS timeseries above | Which cluster is red? Correlate with app-side spikes on the same timeline. Peak-hour scale-out is normal. |\n| **ALB \u2014 5xx rate line moves up** | ApplicationELB section | Which LB? Correlate with backend service (its Lambda / ECS logs) at the same timestamp. |\n| **Everything is flat and green** | \u2705 nothing | This is the good state. Move on. |\n\nFull playbook: **[docs/incident-triage.md](https://github.com/kiseskrap/aws-infra-audit-toolkit/blob/main/observability-lab/docs/incident-triage.md)** \u2014 one page per signal, with the decision tree operators actually follow.\n\n**Cyan vertical lines** on any timeseries panel = a deployment. Hover for `service` / `version`. If the spike is right of a marker, the deploy is a suspect."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "RDS",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RDS \u2014 DatabaseConnections (avg) by cluster",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aws_rds_database_connections_average{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier=~\"$rds_cluster\",dimension_DBClusterIdentifier!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RDS \u2014 CPUUtilization (max) by cluster",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aws_rds_cpuutilization_maximum{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier=~\"$rds_cluster\",dimension_DBClusterIdentifier!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RDS \u2014 Read / Write latency (avg)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aws_rds_read_latency_average{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier=~\"$rds_cluster\",dimension_DBClusterIdentifier!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "read / {{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "aws_rds_write_latency_average{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier=~\"$rds_cluster\",dimension_DBClusterIdentifier!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "write / {{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RDS clusters observed",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count by (dimension_DBClusterIdentifier) (aws_rds_database_connections_average{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier!=\"\"})) OR on() vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RDS \u2014 CPU >= 80% right now",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 13
      },
      "description": "Clusters currently at high CPU. Not necessarily a bad thing if peak-time scale-out is expected; use this to correlate with app-side symptoms.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(aws_rds_cpuutilization_maximum{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier!=\"\"} >= 80) OR on() vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Lambda",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 201,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lambda \u2014 Invocations/s (top 15)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(15, sum by (dimension_FunctionName) (rate(aws_lambda_invocations_sum{dimension_FunctionName=~\"$lambda_fn\",dimension_FunctionName!=\"\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{dimension_FunctionName}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "iops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 202,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lambda \u2014 Errors/s (top 15)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 27
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(15, sum by (dimension_FunctionName) (rate(aws_lambda_errors_sum{dimension_FunctionName=~\"$lambda_fn\",dimension_FunctionName!=\"\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{dimension_FunctionName}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "eps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 203,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lambda \u2014 Duration (max) by function",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(15, aws_lambda_duration_maximum{dimension_FunctionName=~\"$lambda_fn\",dimension_FunctionName!=\"\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{dimension_FunctionName}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 204,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Lambda \u2014 functions with any error (last 15m)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 35
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(sum by (dimension_FunctionName) (increase(aws_lambda_errors_sum{dimension_FunctionName!=\"\"}[15m])) > 0) OR on() vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 205,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Lambda \u2014 throttles (5m)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 35
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(aws_lambda_throttles_sum{dimension_FunctionName!=\"\"}[5m])) OR on() vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Lambda \u2014 Triage (when the stat panel above is not zero)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 39
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lambda \u2014 Error rate % (top 15)",
      "description": "errors / invocations over the last 15 minutes. 0.1% is noise, 1% is worth investigating, 5%+ is an incident.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(15, 100 * sum by (dimension_FunctionName) (increase(aws_lambda_errors_sum{dimension_FunctionName=~\"$lambda_fn\",dimension_FunctionName!=\"\"}[15m])) / clamp_min(sum by (dimension_FunctionName) (increase(aws_lambda_invocations_sum{dimension_FunctionName=~\"$lambda_fn\",dimension_FunctionName!=\"\"}[15m])), 1))",
          "legendFormat": "{{dimension_FunctionName}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Lambda \u2014 Top functions by errors (last 15m) \u2014 click function name",
      "description": "One row per function with any errors in the last 15 minutes, ranked by absolute error count. The 'CloudWatch' link opens Logs Insights filtered to that function's ERROR events.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 40
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (dimension_FunctionName) (increase(aws_lambda_errors_sum{dimension_FunctionName=~\"$lambda_fn\",dimension_FunctionName!=\"\"}[15m])) > 0)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "dimension_FunctionName": "function",
              "Value": "errors (15m)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "error rate"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percentunit"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "yellow",
                      "value": 0.01
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 0.05
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "function"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Open CloudWatch Logs Insights for this function",
                    "url": "https://ap-northeast-2.console.aws.amazon.com/cloudwatch/home?region=ap-northeast-2#logsV2:logs-insights$3FqueryDetail$3D~(end~0~start~-900~timeType~'RELATIVE~unit~'seconds~editorString~'fields*20*40timestamp*2c*20*40message*0a*7c*20filter*20*40message*20like*20*2fERROR*2f*0a*7c*20sort*20*40timestamp*20desc*0a*7c*20limit*20100~source~(~'*2faws*2flambda*2f${__data.fields.function}))",
                    "targetBlank": true
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "ApplicationELB",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 48
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ALB \u2014 5xx rate by LB (per 5m)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 58
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (dimension_LoadBalancer) (rate(aws_applicationelb_httpcode_target_5_xx_count_sum{dimension_LoadBalancer=~\"$alb\",dimension_LoadBalancer!=\"\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{dimension_LoadBalancer}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "eps"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ALB \u2014 Target response time (avg)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 58
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aws_applicationelb_target_response_time_average{dimension_LoadBalancer=~\"$alb\",dimension_LoadBalancer!=\"\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{dimension_LoadBalancer}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "ALB \u2014 inventory",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 66
      },
      "description": "One row per ALB discovered by YACE. Sanity-check that the expected load balancers are all listed here.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aws_applicationelb_request_count_sum{dimension_LoadBalancer!=\"\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true,
              "region": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "dimension_LoadBalancer": 0,
              "account_id": 1,
              "Value": 2
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 150,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "RDS \u2014 Triage (which cluster is high and why)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 151,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "RDS \u2014 Top clusters by peak CPU (last 15m)",
      "description": "Sorted by max CPU over the last 15 minutes. A cluster near 100% during off-peak hours warrants a slow-query check.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, max by (dimension_DBClusterIdentifier) (max_over_time(aws_rds_cpuutilization_maximum{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier!=\"\"}[15m])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "dimension_DBClusterIdentifier": "cluster",
              "Value": "peak CPU %"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "peak CPU %"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "yellow",
                      "value": 50
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 80
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 152,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "RDS \u2014 Top clusters by connections (avg)",
      "description": "Connection totals. A step-change here after a deploy usually means a connection-pool config regression on the app side.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, avg by (dimension_DBClusterIdentifier) (avg_over_time(aws_rds_database_connections_average{dimension_DBClusterIdentifier!=\"\"}[15m])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "dimension_DBClusterIdentifier": "cluster",
              "Value": "avg connections"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 350,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "ALB \u2014 Triage (which LB is loudest right now)",
